{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19622","headline":"题浯溪石 · 皇甫湜","name":"题浯溪石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"次山有文章，可惋只在碎。\n然长於指叙，约洁有余态。\n心语适相应，出句多分外。\n於诸作者间，拔戟成一队。\n中行虽富剧，粹美若可盖。\n子昂感遇佳，未若君雅裁。\n退之全而神，上与千载对。\n李杜才海翻，高下非可概。\n文与一气间，爲物莫与大。\n先王路不荒，岂不仰吾辈。\n石屏立衙衙，溪口扬素濑。\n我思何人知，徙倚如有待。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19622.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19622","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}